Subject: [PATCH] llama: MultiDecode ancestor KQ mask via batch.parent (0129)

Optional llama_batch.parent enables forest packing with tree-depth pos
and ancestor-only attention (siblings masked). Shared KV for common
prefix; exact next-token logits at leaves. v0: single seq, one ubatch.
